====Usage notes====
This was the common term for {{m|en|anime}} in the 1980s, but was supplanted in the 1990s among fans. It now sounds old-fashioned to anime fans, and is sometimes incorrectly claimed to be pejorative. It latterly has come into use to refer to old anime.

